WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:02.948
- [Man] The year was 1946.

00:00:02.948 --> 00:00:05.160
Radio was king, and The
Adventures of Superman

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.646
ruled the airwaves.

00:00:06.646 --> 00:00:08.134
But with fascism vanquished,

00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:10.687
the Man of Steel set his
sights on a different foe.

00:00:10.687 --> 00:00:14.171
This is the story of how
Superman busted the Ku Klux Klan.

00:00:14.171 --> 00:00:16.984
- Because unless we stop
this fiery cross clan now,

00:00:16.984 --> 00:00:19.671
they'll get you no matter where you go.

00:00:19.671 --> 00:00:21.470
- [Man] The story starts
with Stetson Kennedy,

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:22.965
a journalist who infiltrated the Klan

00:00:22.965 --> 00:00:24.627
for the Anti-Defamation League.

00:00:24.627 --> 00:00:27.399
- [Rick] He wanted to
melt the cultural glue

00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:29.261
that held the Klan together.

00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:30.094
- [Man] Thanks, Rick.

00:00:30.094 --> 00:00:30.927
- [Rick] No problem.

00:00:30.927 --> 00:00:32.244
- That's Rick Bowers.
- B-O-W-

00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:33.202
- [Man] He wrote this book.

00:00:33.202 --> 00:00:36.250
- [Rick] Superman Versus The Ku Klux Klan.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.302
- [Man] But what does Stetson Kennedy

00:00:37.302 --> 00:00:38.816
have to do with Superman?

00:00:38.816 --> 00:00:42.614
Remember, the Last Son of
Krypton needed a new enemy.

00:00:42.614 --> 00:00:44.964
- [Rick] The producers of the radio show,

00:00:44.964 --> 00:00:47.028
on a very bold gambit,

00:00:47.028 --> 00:00:51.195
decided Superman would take
on real-life hate groups.

00:00:52.303 --> 00:00:54.704
(upbeat music)

00:00:54.704 --> 00:00:56.341
- [Man] The creators of
The Adventures of Superman

00:00:56.341 --> 00:00:59.680
used Kennedy's research to
produce a 16-part series called

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.233
The Clan of the Fiery Cross.
- The Clan of the Fiery Cross,

00:01:02.233 --> 00:01:05.091
where a great secret society
pledged to purify America.

00:01:05.091 --> 00:01:06.738
- [Rick] The Superman producers went

00:01:06.738 --> 00:01:09.116
to the Anti-Defamation League, and said,

00:01:09.116 --> 00:01:13.184
"Authenticate our script,
provide us more information."

00:01:13.184 --> 00:01:14.937
- [Second Man] It was a
way to get the message out

00:01:14.937 --> 00:01:16.670
that no one else could get out

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:18.714
just by telling horror stories.

00:01:18.714 --> 00:01:21.773
- I am the Grand Scorpion of
the Clan of the Fiery Cross.

00:01:21.773 --> 00:01:23.325
- The Grand Rat, you mean!

00:01:23.325 --> 00:01:26.035
- [Rick] It exposed the
Clan as hate-mongers,

00:01:26.035 --> 00:01:29.162
but it also exposed the Clan

00:01:29.162 --> 00:01:32.551
as a money-driven organization.

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:35.336
- I'm running a business,
Rigs, and so are you!

00:01:35.336 --> 00:01:36.380
We deal in one of the oldest

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:38.664
and most profitable commodities on earth.

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:39.755
Hate.

00:01:39.755 --> 00:01:44.594
- [Rick] It was a break-through
in American broadcasting.

00:01:44.594 --> 00:01:47.446
Not only had they done
this great public service,

00:01:47.446 --> 00:01:49.226
but they elevated themselves

00:01:49.226 --> 00:01:52.693
to the number one radio
show for kids on air.

00:01:52.693 --> 00:01:54.810
- Well they're cowardly
gangsters who operate at night,

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:56.760
hidden behind sheets and hoods.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:58.469
Their minds are diseased with hate.

00:01:58.469 --> 00:01:59.302
No one is safe from them.

00:01:59.302 --> 00:02:00.281
- [Man] I guess you could say

00:02:00.281 --> 00:02:01.814
that the white robes stood no chance

00:02:01.814 --> 00:02:04.122
against the Man of Steel.

00:02:04.122 --> 00:02:06.705
(upbeat music)

